{1 = 1-9}
9=1.	The @fsux{gakkul} vat, the @fsux{gakkul} vat! The @fsux{gakkul} vat, the @fsux{lamsare} vat! The @fsux{gakkul} vat, which puts us in a happy mood! The @fsux{lamsare} vat, which makes the heart rejoice! The @fsux{ugurbal} jar, glory of the house! The @fsux{šaggub} jar, filled with beer! The @fsux{amam} jar, which carries the beer from the @fsux{lamsare} vat! The troughs made with @fsux{bur} grass and the pails for kneading the dough! All the beautiful vessels are ready on their pot stands! 

{10 = 10-20}
45=10.	May the heart of your god be well disposed towards you! 
49=11.	Let the eye of the @fsux{gakkul} vat be our eye, 
53=12.	and let the heart of the @fsux{gakkul} vat be our heart! 
57=13.	What makes your heart feel wonderful in itself  
61=14.	also makes our hearts feel wonderful in themselves! 
65=15.	We are in a happy mood, 
69=16.	our hearts are joyful! 
73=17.	You have poured a libation over the fated brick, 
77=18.	and you have laid the foundations in peace and prosperity -- now may @wDN{Ninkasi} dwell with you! 
81=19.	She should pour beer and wine for you! 
85=20.	Let the pouring of the sweet liquor resound pleasantly for you! 

{21 = 21-31}
89=21.	In the troughs made with @fsux{bur} grass, there is sweet beer. 
93=22.	I will have the cupbearers, the boys and the brewers stand by. 
97=23.	As I spin around the lake of beer, 
101=24.	while feeling wonderful, feeling wonderful, 
105=25.	while drinking beer, 
109=26.	in a blissful mood, 
113=27.	while drinking alcohol and feeling exhilarated, 
117=28.	with joy in the heart and a contented liver -- my heart is a heart filled with joy! 
121=29.	I clothe my contented liver in a garment fit for a queen! 
125=30.	The heart of @wDN{Inana} is happy once again; 
129=31.	the heart of @wDN{Inana} is happy once again! 

{32 = 32}
135=32.	A …… to @wDN{Ninkasi}. 
